# Print-in-place fit proof: the coin + axles must be a free captive body,
# clearing the ring on every surface (rim moat + both teardrop sockets).
# `fitcheck` renders rotor ∩ ring and must be EMPTY. `fitcheck_neg` drives
# the sockets into the axles so it MUST overlap, proving the check can fail.
fitcheck      empty
fitcheck_neg  interferes
